   "body": "**Delta review (Opus 5.5, read-only sub-agent of cloud/orch) of 9b355789, verbatim:**\n\n> **APPROVE**, head 9b355789\n>\n> The round 1 findings are fixed:\n> 1. `LegacyTitleRewrite.swift` is deleted and nothing references it any more. `TopicListDifferentialTests.swift:150` and `FavoritesParserTests.swift:59` now call the shipped `TopicTitle.displayed`. I removed \"topic unique\" from `TopicTitle.spellings` as a test. The differential suite then failed on R04 and R05a rows, for example \"[Topic Unique] La Basse\" against the oracle's \"[TU] La Basse\". With the code restored, it passes again. So the oracle now checks the function that ships.\n> 2. `LOT-022-topic-list-parser.md:15` now gives the current status (`TopicTitle.displayed`, HFRModels, #818).\n>\n> No regression in the delta.\n>\n> **Checked**\n> - `swift test --filter 'TopicTitle|Differential|Favorites'`: 61 tests passed.\n> - Mutation probe above: red without the code, green with it.\n> - `swiftlint lint --strict` on the 2 test files and `TopicTitle.swift`: 0 violations.\n> - LESSONS L01, L08 and L09 checked.\n\nThe App job failed on runner infrastructure (exit 70, \"destination not found\", job 133081638585) and has been re-run. Merge on green.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
